{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c3e1","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0af70-3fbf-7053-9892-4138f0f86cd7"},"sequence":75,"recorded_at":1780531400000145,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"f62214c4-2492-4a7c-b4f9-60a93b7d9183","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"f62214c4-2492-4a7c-b4f9-60a93b7d9183","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"f62214c4-2492-4a7c-b4f9-60a93b7d9183"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0af70-75eb-7a41-9ca1-6763ebf4ee9a"},"task_id":"01a0af70-75eb-7a41-9ca1-6763ebf4ee9a","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0af70-75eb-7a41-9ca1-6763ebf4ee9a","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/resources/TASK-260830-2x16gz/TASK-260830-2x16gz_integration-attempt-rev1.md`.\n1|Integration-attempt run for TASK-260830-2x16gz (test-peer-auth-and-hostile-network-failures, FINAL leaf of STORY-260830-1kiyj6, story_final CR1 accepted by RUN-260917-f36c51). Trunk has advanced to fc67abdfc3888d6683b1eb89bc248e089ca6aca3 (STORY-260830-315721, STORY-260830-2rqigd, STORY-260830-1oqfec and the PR48 routing change landed) since this CR was accepted on base e4e3e8834675cf3814effd3b2673b4931dfbf311, and trunk's advance touches paths this CR also changes (README.md, LOGBOOK.md, internal/traceability/ownership.v0.6.0.json, internal/traceability/traceability.go, …), so §6.2 will refuse the landing with integration_base_moved and demote the Change Request to stale; that demotion is the required precondition for the operator's `worktree invalidate-acceptance` and the refresh/republish cycle. You are the bound producer-role integration run (developer, implementer archetype). Do exactly this from the control root /Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager: (1) git fetch origin and confirm origin/main = fc67abdfc3888d6683b1eb89bc248e089ca6aca3; (2) run `task-board worktree integrate STORY-260830-1kiyj6